<title>USA: AMBAC qualifies five issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>AMBAC qualifies five issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMBAC Indemnity Corp said it has qualified for bond insurance the following five municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--Buffalo, Minn.,$6.965 million general obligation bonds as a direct purchase.</p>
<p>--Las Cruces, N.M., School District No. 2, $10 million school building GOs (elective).</p>
<p>--Sherman CSD, N.Y., $4.875 million school district GOs.</p>
<p>--Lucas, Texas, $2.5 million certificates of obligation.</p>
<p>--Menomonie, Wis., $2.655 million corporate purpose GOs.</p>
<p>((--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650))</p>
</text>
